          "Your hotel name can follow when it is not yet booked; the likely area is often enough for an initial discussion. Do not withhold the rest of the request while deciding between two hotels. Conversely, if your hotel location is what makes a very early departure possible, tell us that it is still uncertain.",
          "If your holiday spans several cities, include the relevant dates for each. We have received requests covering Tokyo and the Kansai area as well as multi-day group itineraries. Each leg needs its own availability and transport checks; agreeing one does not make the others confirmed.",
